      "writtenOn": "2024-10-03T17:57:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think that is a great idea! But it looks like creating the dependency requires us to add this module to the visibility of the system server jars. I am running into build errors like such\n```\nFAILED: out/soong/build.aosp_cf_x86_64_phone.ninja                                                                                                                                                                                                                              \ncd \"$(dirname \"out/host/linux-x86/bin/soong_build\")\" \u0026\u0026 BUILDER\u003d\"$PWD/$(basename \"out/host/linux-x86/bin/soong_build\")\" \u0026\u0026 cd / \u0026\u0026 env -i  \"$BUILDER\"     --top \"$TOP\"     --soong_out \"out/soong\"     --out \"out\"     --soong_variables out/soong/soong.aosp_cf_x86_64_phone.variables -o out/soong/build.aosp_cf_x86_64_phone.ninja -l out/.module_paths/Android.bp.list --available_env out/soong/soong.environment.available --used_env out/soong/soong.environment.used.aosp_cf_x86_64_phone.build Android.bp\nerror: build/soong/Android.bp:135:1: module \"dexpreopt_systemserver_check\" variant \"android_common\": depends on //packages/modules/Bluetooth/service:service-bluetooth which is not visible to this module                                                                      \nYou may need to add \"//build/soong\" to its visibility                                                                                                                                                                                                                           \nerror: build/soong/Android.bp:135:1: module \"dexpreopt_systemserver_check\" variant \"android_common\": depends on //packages/modules/Uwb/service:service-uwb which is not visible to this module                                                                                  \nYou may need to add \"//build/soong\" to its visibility                                                                                                                                                                                                                           \nerror: build/soong/Android.bp:135:1: module \"dexpreopt_systemserver_check\" variant \"android_common\": depends on //packages/modules/Wifi/service:service-wifi which is not visible to this module                                                                                \nYou may need to add \"//build/soong\" to its visibility                                                                                                                                                                                                                           \nerror: build/soong/Android.bp:135:1: module \"dexpreopt_systemserver_check\" variant \"android_common\": depends on //packages/modules/Uwb/ranging/service:service-ranging which is not visible to this module                                                                      \nYou may need to add \"//build/soong\" to its visibility\n\n```\n\nWould it be ok if we defer this option to a followup cleanup?",
      "parentUuid": "28df2e02_86ce1755",
      "revId": "fbdb3c73b290db776349ff8e78ad52cc21badb8c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
