      "writtenOn": "2024-10-04T09:23:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for trying this! The need for visibility looks weird. [`dex_bootjars`](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:build/soong/Android.bp;l\u003d116;drc\u003dda7ba6e88410c98b4fbbf917bef5bfb81e4a9cc3) is also defined in `//build/soong` and it can [add dependencies on boot jars and apexes](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:build/soong/java/dexpreopt_bootjars.go;l\u003d523-532;drc\u003d5351cf28d28cac5a585ab93a63f17c59a2d80ba4) without a problem. Do you know how is that achieved?",
      "parentUuid": "2733d53e_67d88381",
      "revId": "fbdb3c73b290db776349ff8e78ad52cc21badb8c",
