        "id": 1878380
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-10-04T16:23:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I believe `dex_bootjars` creates a dependency on the boot jars and not the system server jars. For bluetooth as an example,\n- `framework-bluetooth` has public visiblity. `framework-bluetooth.impl` has more [restricted visibility](https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Bluetooth/framework/Android.bp;l\u003d70-80;bpv\u003d1), but that is not an issue for `dex_bootjars` since it creates a dependency on the top-level java_sdk_library.\n- `service-bluetooth` is visible only to [packages/modules/Bluetooth/apex](https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/packages/modules/Bluetooth/+/b7aac22e127858325267accb21779db31707b519:service/Android.bp;l\u003d116;drc\u003d2256094a11f3be95b05719eb943cd83ecb6f086c;bpv\u003d1;bpt\u003d0)",
      "parentUuid": "19565db0_9ccff4a6",
